KazeZygisk
==========

KazeZygisk is part of KazeSU (https://github.com/KazeSU/KazeSU).

It is a fork of BuiltZygisk / NyaZygisk
(https://github.com/SukiSU-Nova/BuiltZygisk), which is a fork of
NeoZygisk by JingMatrix (https://github.com/JingMatrix/NeoZygisk).

Upstream authors and copyright holders include:

  JingMatrix        NeoZygisk
  NkBe              NyaZygisk / BuiltZygisk
  Dr-TSNG           Zygisk Next API definitions
  LSPosed           Dobby, LSPlt
  eirv              riscv64-inline-hook

The Zygisk Next API header (loader/src/include/zygisk_next_api.h) and the
public Zygisk API header (loader/src/include/api.hpp,
loader/src/include/zygisk.hpp) retain their upstream notices and must not be
rebranded.

